  {
   "dur": 3.4,
   "voz": "¿Que este Black Friday no te salga caro? Ojo con pagar en tres plazos sin intereses.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><h1 data-in=\"0\" data-d=\"0.4\">Que este Black Friday no te salga <span class=\"g\">caro</span>.</h1><p data-in=\"0.3\">Ojo con el «paga en 3 plazos sin intereses».</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 320\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:80px\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"20\" width=\"840\" height=\"110\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#6F6F6F\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-d=\"0.5\" data-a=\"grow\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"92\" fill=\"#0A0A0A\" font-size=\"50\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.8\" data-a=\"fade\">300 € hoy</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"180\" width=\"260\" height=\"110\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"1.0\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"252\" fill=\"#0A0A0A\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.0\" data-a=\"fade\">100 € · mes 1</text><rect x=\"290\" y=\"180\" width=\"260\" height=\"110\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#2a2a2a\" data-in=\"1.2\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"420\" y=\"252\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.2\" data-a=\"fade\">100 € · mes 2</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"180\" width=\"260\" height=\"110\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#2a2a2a\" data-in=\"1.4\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"252\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.4\" data-a=\"fade\">100 € · mes 3</text></svg></div>"
  },
  {
   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "Comprar ahora y pagar después parece gratis. Pero si lo financia otra empresa, no es un regalo. Es un crédito, aunque no tenga intereses.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">Qué es</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">Sin intereses, pero <span class=\"g\">es un crédito</span>.</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 330\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:90px\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"20\" width=\"240\" height=\"130\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#2a2a2a\" data-in=\"0.4\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"46\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.4\" data-a=\"fade\">Tú</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"20\" width=\"240\" height=\"130\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#2a2a2a\" data-in=\"0.7\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"420\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.7\" data-a=\"fade\">Tienda</text><rect x=\"600\" y=\"20\" width=\"240\" height=\"130\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"1.0\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"720\" y=\"95\" fill=\"#0A0A0A\" font-size=\"38\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.0\" data-a=\"fade\">Financiera</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.6\" data-a=\"fade\">→</text><text x=\"570\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.9\" data-a=\"fade\">←</text><path d=\"M720,165 L720,240 L120,240 L120,175\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F4C542\" stroke-width=\"7\" data-in=\"1.4\" data-d=\"0.8\" data-a=\"draw\"/><text x=\"420\" y=\"310\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.8\" data-a=\"fade\">La financiera paga a la tienda. Tú le devuelves.</text></svg></div>"
  },
  {
   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "Y la Unión Europea ya lo trata así. Desde el veinte de noviembre, la nueva norma obliga a comprobar si puedes pagarlo y a darte la TAE y el coste total.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">Novedad · 20 de noviembre</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">La UE ya lo trata como <span class=\"g\">crédito</span>.</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 380\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:80px\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"68\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F4C542\" stroke-width=\"6\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"82\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"38\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-a=\"fade\">Solvencia</text><text x=\"840\" y=\"82\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"40\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"end\" data-in=\"0.6\" data-a=\"fade\">¿puedes pagarlo?</text><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"840\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"188\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F4C542\" stroke-width=\"6\" data-in=\"0.8\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"202\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"38\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.8\" data-a=\"fade\">Información</text><text x=\"840\" y=\"202\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"40\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"end\" data-in=\"0.8999999999999999\" data-a=\"fade\">TAE y coste total</text><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"840\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"308\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F4C542\" stroke-width=\"6\" data-in=\"1.1\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"322\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"38\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.1\" data-a=\"fade\">Consentimiento</text><text x=\"840\" y=\"322\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"40\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"end\" data-in=\"1.2\" data-a=\"fade\">nada premarcado</text><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"840\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"#2a2a2a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></svg><div class=\"src\" data-in=\"1.8\" data-a=\"fade\">Directiva (UE) 2023/2225, de crédito al consumo, aplicable desde el 20/11/2026. Incluye el pago a plazos financiado por terceros, también sin intereses y por menos de 200 €.</div></div>"
  },
  {
   "dur": 3.0,
   "voz": "Eso sí, España aún no ha aprobado su ley. De momento, se aplica la normativa actual.",
   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">¿Y en España?</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">La ley española <span class=\"g\">aún no está</span>.</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 270\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:90px\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"130\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#F4C542\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"108\" fill=\"#0A0A0A\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-a=\"fade\">Anteproyecto</text><rect x=\"290\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"130\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6F6F6F\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-dasharray=\"12 10\" data-in=\"0.8\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"420\" y=\"108\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"0.8\" data-a=\"fade\">Congreso</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"130\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6F6F6F\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-dasharray=\"12 10\" data-in=\"1.1\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"108\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-in=\"1.1\" data-a=\"fade\">BOE</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"240\" fill=\"#CFCFCA\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.5\" data-a=\"fade\">Mientras, rige la normativa española actual.</text></svg><div class=\"src\" data-in=\"1.8\" data-a=\"fade\">Situación a 21/11/2026: anteproyecto aprobado en primera vuelta en enero de 2026. Fuentes: Qué! (21/11/2026); Hoy Aragón (12/11/2026).</div></div>"
