   "html": "<div style=\"width:840px\"><div class=\"k\" data-in=\"0.1\">Antes de aceptar</div><h2 data-in=\"0.2\">Tres preguntas <span class=\"g\">rápidas</span>.</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 840 410\" width=\"840\" style=\"margin-top:80px\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"20\" width=\"840\" height=\"105\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#2a2a2a\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"88\" fill=\"#F4C542\" font-size=\"48\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.5\" data-a=\"fade\">1</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.6\" data-a=\"fade\">¿Quién lo financia?</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"150\" width=\"840\" height=\"105\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#2a2a2a\" data-in=\"0.9\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"218\" fill=\"#F4C542\" font-size=\"48\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"0.9\" data-a=\"fade\">2</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"216\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.0\" data-a=\"fade\">¿Y si me retraso?</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"280\" width=\"840\" height=\"105\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#2a2a2a\" data-in=\"1.3\" data-a=\"pop\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"348\" fill=\"#F4C542\" font-size=\"48\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.3\" data-a=\"fade\">3</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"346\" fill=\"#F5F5F2\" font-size=\"44\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-in=\"1.4\" data-a=\"fade\">¿Lo pagaría hoy?</text></svg><div class=\"src\" data-in=\"2.0\" data-a=\"fade\">Un retraso puede tener comisiones aunque la compra sea «sin intereses». Revisa las condiciones.</div></div>"
